(Why convexity matters for optimisation) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(For a convex function every local minimum is a global minimum.) Tj T*
(That is why gradient descent with a small enough step size finds) Tj T*
(the best answer on a convex problem, and why it can get stuck on a) Tj T*
(non-convex one.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Second-order test: a twice-differentiable function is convex when) Tj T*
(its Hessian matrix is positive semidefinite everywhere.) Tj T*
